  - OR 'file_path' exists but is highly suspicious (e.g., \\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\, \\\\Temp\\\\).\\n   - OR the same external IP is observed across multiple recent events or similar alerts, indicating possible infrastructure reuse.\\n   - OR the script is heavily obfuscated and lacks identifiable authorized application paths.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a concise Description field including: 1) Script intent, 2) File Path existence/legitimacy (mentioning if the field was missing), 3) VT and AbuseIPDB results, if they exist, and 4) Final reasoning.\", \"logic\": \"Ensures the summary explicitly clarifies whether the triage was based on a physical file path or script behavior alone.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-9921\", \"alert_name\": \"Suspicious PowerShell Script Execution\", \"start_time\": \"2026-01-20T02:15:44.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"192.168.1.45\", \"endpoint\": \"FS-PROD-02\", \"user\": \"NT SERVICE\\\\DataBackupAgent\", \"user_id\": \"S-1-5-80-3245\", \"description\": \"A suspicious PowerShell script was executed on the host.\", \"evidence\": {\"scriptblock\": \"param($TargetDrive = 'C:', $ThresholdGB = 10)\\n\\n# DataVault Backup - Pre-Scan Inventory Script\\n$LogPath = 'C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\DataVault\\\\Logs\\\\inventory_scan.log'\\n$ReportPath = 'C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\DataVault\\\\Temp\\\\large_files.csv'\\n\\nfunction Write-Log($Message) {\\n    $TS = Get-Date -Format 'yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss'\\n    \\\"[$TS] $Message\\\" | Out-File -FilePath $LogPath -Append\\n}\\n\\ntry {\\n    Write-Log 'Starting storage inventory scan...'\\n    $LargeFiles = Get-ChildItem -Path $TargetDrive -Recurse -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | \\n                  Where-Object { $_.Length -gt ($ThresholdGB * 1GB) } | \\n                  Select-Object Name, @{Name='SizeGB';Expression={$_.Length / 1GB}}, FullName\\n    \\n    $LargeFiles | Export-Csv -Path $ReportPath -NoTypeInformation\\n    Write-Log \\\"Scan complete. Found $($LargeFiles.Count) files exceeding threshold.\\\"\\n}\\ncatch {\\n    Write-Log \\\"Error during scan: $($_.Exception.Message)\\\"\\n}\", \"os\": \"Windows Server 2019 Standard\"}, \"technique\": {\"name\": \"File and Directory Discovery\", \"killchain_stage\": \"Discovery\"}}"
  }
]

