events' AND 'get_recent_similar_alerts' to understand host context.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if the host has a history of similar volume spikes or communication with this root domain.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Correlation and Triage Decision\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the normalized domain age, decoded payload results, and the endpoint's role.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - The root domain is verified infrastructure.\\n   - AND the subdomains match known patterns (e.g., DNSSEC sentinel).\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **Decoded payloads contain sensitive host data.**\\n   - OR the root domain is newly registered (< 30 days).\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-14567\", \"alert_name\": \"DNS Tunneling Anomaly\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-06T14:30:10.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"10.150.22.105\", \"destination_ip\": \"45.15.201.33\", \"endpoint\": \"srv-prod-web-01\", \"description\": \"An anomalously large amount (2,140 Bytes) of tunneled, high-entropy traffic through DNS (domain: update-check-cdn.xyz) was observed.\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"Network\", \"application\": \"DNS\", \"query_type\": \"TXT\", \"actual_bytes\": 2140, \"typical_bytes\": 15, \"sample_queries\": [\"ZmlsZW5hbWU9c2hhZG93LmJhaw.update-check-cdn.xyz\", \"Y2h1bms9MDF8ZGF0YT1IZWxsbyU.update-check-cdn.xyz\", \"Y2h1bms9MDJ8ZGF0YT0yMHdvcmxk.update-check-cdn.xyz\", \"Y2h1bms9MDN8ZGF0YT1leGZpbA.update-check-cdn.xyz\"]}}"
